<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Move Div with jQuery</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        #child-box {
            background-color: #ef4444;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 20px auto;
            width: 80%;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        #parent-box {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
            color: #64748b;
            padding: 30px 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            min-height: 60px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        #parent-box h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .move-btn {
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .move-btn:hover {
            background-color: #1d4ed8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>jQuery Element Mover</h2>
        <p>Click the button below to move the Red Box inside the Grey Target Box.</p>
        
        <button id="btn-move" class="move-btn">Move Inside Target</button>

        <div id="child-box">
            📦 I am the Red Box (Child)
        </div>

        <div id="parent-box">
            <h3>🎯 Target Box (Parent)</h3>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        $(document).ready(function() {
            
            $('#btn-move').on('click', function() {
                $('#child-box').appendTo('#parent-box');
                $(this).text('Moved Successfully!').prop('disabled', true).css('opacity', '0.6');
            });

        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
